{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54455","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵之道，切忌起无名。\n不止（京本作「正」）少功虚效力，逡巡反（川本作「及」）祸复（京本作「复祸」）危倾。\n容易勿言兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}